#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER"
