#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW"
