#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_BACKUPBODY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_BACKUPBODY.GENERIC"
msgid "That WX is ahead of their time."
msgstr "Quel WX è davvero avanti rispetto ai tempi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_DELIVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_DELIVERY"
msgid "Nothing beats a speedy delivery."
msgstr "Niente di meglio di una consegna tempestiva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_SCOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_SCOUT"
msgid "And where are we off to next?"
msgstr "Dove andiamo ora?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP"
msgid "Mind where you're zapping!"
msgstr "Attento a chi fulmini!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP_REMOTE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP_REMOTE.GENERIC"
msgid "In the wrong hands... nevermind."
msgstr "Nelle mani sbagliate... Ah, non importa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.GENERIC"
msgid "It's too hard to eat."
msgstr "È troppo dura per essere mangiata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.WET"
msgid "WX, how kind of you..."
msgstr "WX, che pensiero gentile..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_GESTALTTRAPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_GESTALTTRAPPER"
msgid "Madness..."
msgstr "Che follia..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.GENERIC"
msgid "I know better than to question the physics."
msgstr "Mai mettere in discussione le leggi della fisica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.HELD"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr "only_used_by_wx78"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER"
msgid "Did the automaton make off with one of my tools?"
msgstr "L'automa è fuggito con uno dei miei strumenti?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_POSSESSEDBODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_POSSESSEDBODY"
msgid "That will never not give me the creeps."
msgstr "Mi fa sempre accapponare la pelle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC"
msgid "Please buzz around elsewhere, you're distracting me!"
msgstr "Vattene a ronzare altrove, mi stai distraendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING"
msgid "Please buzz around elsewhere, you're distracting me!"
msgstr "Vattene a ronzare altrove, mi stai distraendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING"
msgid "Please buzz around elsewhere, you're distracting me!"
msgstr "Vattene a ronzare altrove, mi stai distraendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM"
msgid "It's biding its time."
msgstr "Sta attendendo il suo momento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED"
msgid "I suppose you have nothing better to do than wait around?"
msgstr "Immagino tu non abbia di meglio da fare che aspettare, eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_DEBUFFER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_DEBUFFER"
msgid "It makes fighting more efficient for WX."
msgstr "La conoscenza è potere."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER"
msgid "Of course an automaton would automate."
msgstr "È naturale che un automa voglia automatizzare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO"
msgid "I don't trust it."
msgstr "Non mi fido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET"
msgid "Just the boost I needed."
msgstr "È proprio la spinta che mi serviva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM"
msgid "It won't do much good by itself."
msgstr "Non serve a molto da sola."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE"
msgid "Knowing where everyone is saves me a lot of time."
msgstr "Sapere dove sono tutti mi fa risparmiare un mucchio di tempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF"
msgid "Does no one else think summoning a small STAR might be dangerous?"
msgstr "Nessuno pensa che evocare una piccola STELLA potrebbe essere pericoloso?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It sure burnt away quickly."
msgstr "È bruciato in un batter d'occhio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Now what did this need? My memory's a bit fuzzy..."
msgstr "Cosa serviva qui? Non ricordo molto bene..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I do love to tinker with new things..."
msgstr "Mi piace armeggiare con cose nuove..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "I love a nice memento, they help me keep track of when I am."
msgstr "Mi piace un bel ricordo, mi aiuta a tenere traccia di quando mi trovo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.YOTB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.YOTB"
msgid "Where's that peculiar judge? He might have an appreciation for this."
msgstr "Dov'è quel giudice bizzarro? Penso che questa potrebbe piacergli."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.GENERIC"
msgid "I love a nice memento, they help me keep track of when I am."
msgstr "Mi piace un bel ricordo, mi aiuta a tenere traccia di quando mi trovo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.YOTB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.YOTB"
msgid "Where's that peculiar judge? He might have an appreciation for this."
msgstr "Dov'è quel giudice bizzarro? Penso che questa potrebbe piacergli."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FESTIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FESTIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "I love a nice memento, they help me keep track of when I am."
msgstr "Mi piace un bel ricordo, mi aiuta a tenere traccia di quando mi trovo."

