msgstr "La bistecca sonnecchia..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED"
msgid "My beast could use some more meat on its bones."
msgstr "Alla mia bestia non nuocerebbe essere più robusta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT"
