msgstr "Forno su un bastone!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL"
