#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG"
msgid "I can't help but wonder how it might taste fried in butter."
msgstr "Non posso fare a meno di chiedermi che sapore abbia saltata in padella."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT"
