msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "Have I not been found worthy?"
msgstr "Non sono degno?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN"
msgid "It's like a spatula for a saddle."
msgstr "È come una spatola per una sella."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC"
msgid "Let's see if I can ride on this."
msgstr "Vediamo se riesco a usarla per cavalcare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE"
msgid "Adds a little spice to my ride."
msgstr "Aggiunge un po' di pepe alla mia corsa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW"
msgid "Best seat in the house!"
msgstr "Non c'è posto migliore!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR"
msgid "Durable."
msgstr "Resistente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "Too much? Mais non, I think the wings are very tasteful!"
msgstr "Se sono di troppo? Mais non, penso che le ali siano di buon gusto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALSA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALSA"
msgid "I like to spice things up!"
msgstr "Mi piacciono le cose piccanti!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX"
msgid "Just the thing for preserving ingredients."
msgstr "Quello che mi serviva per conservare gli ingredienti."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK"
msgid "Too salty."
msgstr "Troppo salato."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED"
msgid "This is more than a dash."
msgstr "È ben più di un pizzico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK"
msgid "Quelle chance! I've found salt!"
msgstr "Quelle chance! Ho trovato il sale!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC"
msgid "What beautiful formations!"
msgstr "Che belle formazioni!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING"
msgid "The sea is capable of amazing things."
msgstr "Il mare è capace di cose straordinarie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT"
msgid "Nothing left, I'm afraid."
msgstr "Temo che non sia rimasto nulla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG"
msgid "Merci beacoup for the salt, mon ami!"
msgstr "Merci beacoup per il sale, mon ami!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT"
msgid "It makes me look quite distinguished, non?"
msgstr "Mi dona un aspetto piuttosto distinto, non?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK"
msgid "Very thick sand."
msgstr "Sabbia molto compatta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE"
msgid "Watch yourself, it's quite sharp."
msgstr "Attenzione, è molto appuntita."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "It's tugging on my mind."
msgstr "Sta tirando la mia mente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "The darkness lurks within."
msgstr "L'oscurità si nasconde all'interno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING"
msgid "Those burn quite dramatically."
msgstr "Quelli ardono molto bene."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED"
msgid "Would some nice soup make you feel better?"
msgstr "Un bel brodino ti farebbe sentire un po' meglio?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING"
msgid "It's coming down with something."
msgstr "Deve avere qualcosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Those could be key to my continued survival."
msgstr "Potrebbero essere la chiave della mia sopravvivenza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED"
msgid "There is nothing left for me to grasp!"
msgstr "Non c'è rimasto più niente da prendere per me."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED"
msgid "It could use some love."
msgstr "Gli servirebbe un po' di amore."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA"
msgid "What is this they're cooking up?"
msgstr "Cosa sta preparando?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING"
msgid "What a tragedy."
msgstr "Che tragedia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT"
msgid "Overcooked."
msgstr "Stracotto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC"
msgid "He seems nice."
msgstr "Molto carino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON"
msgid "A kitchen mishap, maybe?"
msgstr "Un piccolo contrattempo in cucina, forse?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE"
msgid "Ah! Someone has left a page here."
msgstr "Ah! Qualcuno ha lasciato qui una pagina."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT"
msgid "One werepig's pauldron is another man's chapeau, non?"
msgstr "Lo spallaccio di un maiale mannaro può essere il chapeau di qualcun altro, non?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT"
msgid "It provides a lovely view!"
msgstr "Fornisce uno splendido panorama!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK"
msgid "Ready for the chisel."
msgstr "Pronta per il cesello."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Overcooked."
msgstr "Stracotto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "Just need some stone to get cooking."
msgstr "Mi servono solo delle pietre per mettermi a cucinare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE"
msgid "Someone's a very talented artist."
msgstr "C'è in giro un artista di grande talento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Some old, worn stone."
msgstr "Una vecchia pietra consumata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "It looks much better."
msgstr "L'aspetto è molto migliorato."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY"
msgid "I think... it's stirring!"
msgstr "Penso che stia... succedendo qualcosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "It looks incomplete."
msgstr "Sembra incompleta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD"
msgid "I think it was part of a statue."
msgstr "Penso che sia un pezzo di una statua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED"
msgid "What an odd shape for a rock."
msgstr "Che strana forma per essere una roccia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "Well, it's fixed now."
msgstr "Beh, adesso è a posto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY"
msgid "I think... it's stirring!"
msgstr "Penso che stia... succedendo qualcosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "It's looking for its missing piece."
msgstr "Sta cercando il pezzo che gli manca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD"
msgid "Looks like it came off a sculpture somewhere."
msgstr "Sembra appartenere a una scultura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Parts of it look like they were sculpted."
msgstr "Alcune parti sembrano essere state scolpite."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "That looks nice."
msgstr "Sembra piacevole."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY"
msgid "I think... it's stirring!"
msgstr "Penso che stia... succedendo qualcosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "Where is your nose?"
msgstr "Dov'è il naso?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE"
msgid "That doesn't look like a natural rock."
msgstr "Non sembra una roccia naturale."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT"
msgid "It's all gone up in smoke."
msgstr "È andato tutto in fiamme!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC"
msgid "All the knowledge of a seasoned seafarer!"
msgstr "Tutta la conoscenza di un esperto navigatore!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO"
msgid "Incredible! Just like Nana used to make!"
msgstr "Incredibile! Proprio come quello della nonna!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK"
msgid "A big lumpy rock."
msgstr "Una grossa roccia sformata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE"
msgid "This reminds me of my little oven back home."
msgstr "Mi ricorda il mio piccolo forno a casa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL"
msgid "Something is cooking."
msgstr "Qualcosa bolle in pentola."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH"
msgid "A little organization never hurts."
msgstr "Un po' di organizzazione non fa mai male."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEEDS"
msgid "You may grow up to be delicious one day."
msgstr "Crescerai per essere una delizia un giorno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
msgid "Could use smoked paprika..."
msgstr "Mi servirebbe della paprica affumicata..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD"
msgid "It's watching over us."
msgstr "Ci tiene d'occhio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT"
msgid "Not exactly my specialty."
msgstr "Non esattamente la mia specialità."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT"
msgid "Ah, I almost feel bad for it now."
msgstr "Ah, ora mi sento quasi in colpa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC"
msgid "I feel as though it's staring at me."
msgstr "È come se mi stesse osservando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE"
msgid "Winona is really very resourceful."
msgstr "Winona è molto intraprendente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER"
msgid "They keep getting odder..."
msgstr "Diventano sempre più strani..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER"
msgid "Oh, how odd."
msgstr "Oh, che strano."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART"
msgid "That beef heart is almost certainly past its prime."
msgstr "Quel cuore di manzo è della più infima qualità."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "The ground is crumbling!"
msgstr "Il terreno si sta sgretolando!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.BODY"
msgid "That will not fit in any pot."
msgstr "Non ho una pentola abbastanza grande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.FLIPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.FLIPPED"
msgid "It has gone belly up."
msgstr "È a gambe all'aria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.HEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.HEAD"
msgid "Impressive jaws."
msgstr "Che mascelle imponenti."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS"
msgid "I don't want to end up in its clutches."
msgstr "Non voglio finire tra le sue grinfie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS"
msgid "Oh my, it looks hungry... and I'm probably delicious!"
msgstr "Santo cielo, sembra affamato... e probabilmente sono squisito!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH"
msgid "It smiles, but is it happy?"
msgstr "Sorride, ma è felice?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE"
msgid "It is one bad customer."
msgstr "Un pessimo cliente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS"
msgid "My fears have taken flight!"
msgstr "Le mie paure hanno preso il volo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE"
msgid "I've never seen a cleaver like that before."
msgstr "Non avevo mai visto una mannaia simile prima d'ora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL"
msgid "Ring the bell for seconds!"
msgstr "È l'ora del secondo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE"
msgid "A place for dark concoctions."
msgstr "Un luogo per miscugli oscuri."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT"
msgid "I'll just put these pieces together, and voilà!"
msgstr "Unirò questi pezzi, et voilà!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_HEART_VEIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_HEART_VEIN"
msgid "It has roots and grows in the dirt, but that is no vegetable."
msgstr "Ha delle radici e cresce nel terreno, ma non è un ortaggio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE"
msgid "There was no effort here."
msgstr "Qualcuno non si è impegnato molto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHARK"
msgid "I'm sure you can find something much tastier to eat elsewhere!"
msgstr "Sono certo che riusciremo a trovare qualcosa di più gustoso da qualche altra parte!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI"
msgid "It looks rather tough."
msgstr "Sembra piuttosto forte..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHELLWEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHELLWEAVER"
msgid "These recipes all call for a pinch of salt."
msgstr "Tutte queste ricette richiedono un pizzico di sale."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER"
msgid "Perhaps I could break it open?"
msgstr "Forse potrei romperlo per aprirlo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR"
msgid "Mon dieu, it seems I have another mouth to feed..."
msgstr "Mon dieu, a quanto pare, ho un'altra bocca da sfamare..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL"
msgid "I'm not the landscaping type."
msgstr "Non sono un tipo da paesaggio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "I almost hate to get it dirty."
msgstr "Quasi mi spiace sporcarla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT"
msgid "Not the stuffed champignon I had in mind."
msgstr "Non è lo champignon ripieno a cui stavo pensando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE"
msgid "It certainly has a unique flavor profile."
msgstr "Ha indiscutibilmente un profilo aromatico unico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN"
msgid "Oh dear. I'm not sure I like that."
