msgid "Is that... a tiny jumping rope?"
msgstr "Ma quella... è una piccola corda per saltare?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT"
msgid "Such perserverance! Tres bon!"
msgstr "Che perseveranza! Très bien!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM"
msgid "I'd better begin training my carrat!"
msgstr "Farei meglio a cominciare ad allenare il mio caratto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT"
msgid "Check!"
msgstr "Punto di controllo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM"
msgid "Ah, this will keep the carrat's on course."
msgstr "Ah, questo terrà in pista il caratto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt to a crisp."
msgstr "Bruciato fino a croccare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC"
msgid "La fin!"
msgstr "La fin!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON"
msgid "We've won, mon ami!"
msgstr "Abbiamo vinto, mon ami!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON"
msgid "{winner}'s carrat ran quite the race! Well done!"
msgstr "Il caratto di {winner} ha fatto una gran bella corsa! Ottimo lavoro!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM"
msgid "Every race needs a finish line."
msgstr "A ogni corsa serve un traguardo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START"
msgid "Where do I even begin... oh, right here!"
msgstr "Da dove comincio... Ah, da qui!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM"
msgid "This will make a fine starting point."
msgstr "Questo sarà un ottimo punto di partenza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT"
msgid "It's been overcooked."
msgstr "È troppo... cotta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT"
msgid "Perhaps we should train some more."
msgstr "Forse dovremmo allenarci un po' di più."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD"
msgid "I can taste victory already!"
msgstr "Sento già il sapore della vittoria!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC"
msgid "It takes four main ingredients to make a first-rate racer."
msgstr "Per un corridore di prima qualità servono quattro ingredienti principali."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM"
msgid "I hope I get a high rating."
msgstr "Spero di ottenere un'ottima valutazione."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "I wonder what will grow from this?"
msgstr "Chissà a cosa daranno vita?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE"
msgid "I hope it grows into some tasty ingredients."
msgstr "Spero che diventino degli ottimi ingredienti freschi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR"
msgid "It seems a shame to drop such a dazzling thing into the sea."
msgstr "È un peccato gettare in mare qualcosa di tanto abbagliante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "Looks like a recipe for an anchor."
msgstr "Sembra la ricetta di un'ancora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt to a crisp!"
msgstr "Qualcuno lo voleva ben cotto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Like a barbeque, it requires charcoal."
msgstr "Come un barbecue, ha bisogno di carbonella."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I wonder what delights it will produce."
msgstr "Chissà quali bontà produrrà!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR"
msgid "Somehow it's making me hungry for a big juicy drumstick..."
msgstr "Mi fa venire voglia di una bella coscia succulenta..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "Today I am sailing in style!"
msgstr "Oggi navigo con stile!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "We can't set sail without this."
msgstr "Non possiamo salpare senza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM"
msgid "Aw, it looks like fun!"
msgstr "Oh, sembra divertente!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT"
msgid "A helmet for a brave knight!"
msgstr "Un elmo per un cavaliere coraggioso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Nothing but ashes!"
msgstr "Nient'altro che cenere!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What does le cheval require?"
msgstr "Cosa serve a le cheval?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "That should do!"
msgstr "Dovrebbe andare bene!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK"
msgid "I will be quick as a horse!"
msgstr "Sarò rapido come un cavallo al galoppo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE"
msgid "This will make a big shish kebab!"
msgstr "Potrò preparare degli spiedini magnifici!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "What a treat it is to be cooked for for a change!"
msgstr "È bello quando, una volta ogni tanto, qualcuno cucina per te!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "Respectfully I think I may pass on this course."
msgstr "Con tutto il rispetto, credo che passerò."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "I'd never turn my nose up at street food."
msgstr "Quando si tratta di street food, non sono mai schizzinoso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL"
msgid "Ah, some lovely mood lighting!"
msgstr "Oh, l'ideale per creare un'illuminazione d'atmosfera!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT"
msgid "C'est dommage, its little fire has burnt out."
msgstr "C'est dommage, il suo fuoco si è spento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM"
msgid "Now, to find the perfect placement for it."
msgstr "Ora non mi resta che trovare un posto adatto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL"
msgid "Ah, some lovely mood lighting!"
msgstr "Oh, l'ideale per creare un'illuminazione d'atmosfera!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT"
msgid "C'est dommage, its little fire has burnt out."
msgstr "C'est dommage, il suo fuoco si è spento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM"
msgid "Now, to find the perfect placement for it."
msgstr "Ora non mi resta che trovare un posto adatto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC"
msgid "No one seems to be using it right now."
msgstr "Sembra che ora non lo stia usando nessuno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING"
msgid "It's all fun and games until someone gets a mouthful of pillow fluff."
msgstr "Un bel gioco dura poco, quando si corre il rischio di trovarsi l'imbottitura di un cuscino in bocca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT"
msgid "I have all my ingredients right here."
msgstr "Ho tutti gli ingredienti a portata di mano."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1"
msgid "It's been so long since I've had such a scrumptious bite of carrot cake!"
msgstr "Era da molto tempo che non assaggiavo una torta di carote tanto gustosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2"
msgid "A part of me expected it to be cheesecake."
msgstr "Parte di me si aspettava che fosse una cheesecake."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3"
msgid "A feast for the eyes and my stomach."
msgstr "Un tripudio tanto per gli occhi quanto per lo stomaco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4"
msgid "Perfectly doughy."
msgstr "Hanno una pastosità perfetta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "A bit too well-done."
msgstr "Un po' troppo cotto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Are you hungry, monsieur?"
msgstr "Hai fame, monsieur?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I do enjoy a good rabbit stew. I should show them my appreciation."
msgstr "Lo stufato di coniglio mi piace molto. Dovrei mostrare loro quanto li apprezzo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN"
msgid "Surely we can settle this without violence?"
msgstr "Non possiamo risolvere la questione senza violenza?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "Hey! I was using that!"
msgstr "Ehi! Mi serviva!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "It sets a festive mood!"
msgstr "Crea un'atmosfera festiva!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM"
msgid "It will look lovely in the evening."
msgstr "Avrà un aspetto magnifico di sera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "The worm is toast."
msgstr "Il verme è bruciato."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I think monster meat is on the menu!"
msgstr "Penso che aggiungeremo la carne di mostro al menù!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "The worm is well fed!"
msgstr "Il verme è ben pasciuto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM"
msgid "Look out for that most exquisite worm!"
msgstr "Fate attenzione a quel verme squisito!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Flame broiled."
msgstr "Consumato dalle fiamme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I should give it a little gift."
msgstr "Dovrei fargli un piccolo regalo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "What should we cook up together?"
msgstr "Cosa dovremmo preparare insieme?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_GENERIC"
msgid "It is what it is..."
msgstr "È quello che è..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY"
msgid "The picture of health."
msgstr "L'immagine della salute."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED"
msgid "Something's troubling it."
msgstr "C'è qualcosa che la turba."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY"
msgid "I think it needs some company."
msgstr "Penso che abbia bisogno di compagnia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS"
msgid "It's hungry for some good conversation."
msgstr "Brama una bella conversazione."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS"
msgid "Perhaps it's time I did some weeding."
msgstr "Forse è ora che strappi tutte le erbacce."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE"
msgid "Would you care for a drink of water?"
msgstr "Ti andrebbe un po' d'acqua fresca?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS"
msgid "Some fresh nutrients might be just the thing to perk it up."
msgstr "Dei nutrienti freschi sarebbero l'ideale per tirarla su."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING"
msgid "The garden's a bit crowded, non?"
msgstr "L'orto è un po' affollato, non?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON"
msgid "Hm... this one might not be in season."
msgstr "Uhm... forse non è la sua stagione."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED"
msgid "This is a very troubled plant."
msgstr "Questa pianta ha molti problemi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING"
msgid "I fear that that is about to cook itself."
msgstr "Ho paura che stia per cucinarsi da solo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_TOODARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE_TOODARK"
msgid "I cannot see a thing!"
msgstr "Non riesco a vedere niente!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED"
msgid "Fresh! Err... perhaps too fresh."
msgstr "Fresco! Ehm... forse troppo fresco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "Do I taste a hint of cinnamon?"
msgstr "C'è un pizzico di cannella?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE"
msgid "This doesn't look good."
msgstr "Si mette male."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT"
msgid "I should have taken that off sooner."
msgstr "Avrei dovuto toglierlo prima dal fuoco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE"
msgid "As a chef, I am quite embarrassed."
msgstr "In quanto chef, mi sento molto in imbarazzo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN"
msgid "I'm almost sorry to leave!"
msgstr "Quasi mi spiace andarmene!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.WENDY_SKILLTREE_EASTEREGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.WENDY_SKILLTREE_EASTEREGG"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE"
msgid "Where art thou, raven? Do show yourself!"
msgstr "Dove sei, corvo? Palesati!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN"
msgid "Fie! There's naught to pillage!"
msgstr "Che infamia! Non c'è nulla da saccheggiare!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY"
msgid "His attention lies elsewhere."
msgstr "La sua attenzione è altrove."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS"
msgid "This hunt will require more players."
msgstr "Questa caccia richiede più partecipanti."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS"
msgid "This is not a worthy stage for our players!"
msgstr "Questo non è un palcoscenico degno dei nostri attori!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY"
msgid "Let us reprise another time."
msgstr "Replicheremo in un'altra occasione."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE"
msgid "Thou shalt not keep me out!"
msgstr "Non mi terrai fuori!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED"
msgid "It is not trained to carry such things."
msgstr "Non è stato addestrato a portare questo genere di cose."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL"
msgid "It seems the ravens hath returned to Odin."
msgstr "Sembra che i corvi siano tornati da Odino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr "only_used_by_wurt"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT"
msgid "It belongs to the metal warrior."
msgstr "Appartiene al guerriero di metallo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM"
msgid "The little beastie must gather her own legions."
msgstr "Dev'essere quella bestiolina a radunare le sue legioni."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE"
msgid "This beautiful beast only obeys its master."
msgstr "Questa splendida bestia obbedisce solo alla sua padrona."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW"
msgid "Thou wouldst send me into the fray unarmed?"
msgstr "Mi getteresti nella mischia disarmata?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.NO_ELIXIRABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.NO_ELIXIRABLE"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER"
msgid "'Tis excess!"
msgstr "È troppo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.COOLDOWN"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr "only_used_by_wx78"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.NOTENOUGHSLOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.NOTENOUGHSLOTS"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr "only_used_by_wx78"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW"
msgid "Finish thine business with haste! I have glory to attain!"
msgstr "Completa in fretta il tuo lavoro! Devo ottenere la gloria!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH"
msgid "Alas, I am too stricken."
msgstr "Ahimè, sono troppo danneggiata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED"
msgid "Someone has enchanted it already."
msgstr "Qualcuno ci ha già lanciato un incantesimo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED"
msgid "'Tis shielded!"
msgstr "Ha una protezione!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION"
msgid "It is not my time yet."
msgstr "Non è ancora il mio turno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET"
msgid "I can only command one beastie!"
msgstr "Posso avere il comando di una sola bestiola!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED"
msgid "I must first dismount from my mighty steed."
msgstr "Devo prima smontare dal mio possente destriero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON"
msgid "I hath already found a guide."
msgstr "Ho già trovato una guida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE"
msgid "I must move with greater haste!"
msgstr "Devo procedere più rapidamente!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING"
msgid "The inferno doth singe me."
msgstr "Quelle fiamme mi bruciano."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE"
msgid "'Tis a task for one."
msgstr "È un compito per una sola persona."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.CANT_SPELL_MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.CANT_SPELL_MOUNTED"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr "only_used_by_willow"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NOT_ENOUGH_EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NOT_ENOUGH_EMBERS"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr "only_used_by_willow"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_BATTERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_BATTERY"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_CATAPULTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_CATAPULTS"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_TARGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_TARGETS"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr "only_used_by_willow"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.SPELL_ON_COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.SPELL_ON_COOLDOWN"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr "only_used_by_willow"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTSPELL.TERRAFORM_TOO_SOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CASTSPELL.TERRAFORM_TOO_SOON"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr "only_used_by_wurt"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING"
msgid "Gasp! My furs!"
msgstr "Argh! Le mie pellicce!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC"
msgid "That's where I keep all my favorite furs and pelts."
msgstr "Ecco dove tengo tutte le mie pellicce e pelli preferiti."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE"
msgid "I shall let them select their garments first."
msgstr "Lascerò che scelga prima le sue vesti."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT"
msgid "I cannot groom without a beast."
msgstr "Non posso fare la toletta senza una bestia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR"
msgid "First the beast must grow back its mane."
msgstr "Prima la bestia dovrà far ricrescere la sua chioma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL"
msgid "Brimming with power like Mjolnir!"
msgstr "Trabocca di potenza, proprio come Mjollnir!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE"
msgid "Alas! The charge doth fail!"
msgstr "Ahimé! La carica non ha funzionato!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "This wee beastie will not bring me glory."
msgstr "Questa bestiolina non mi darà gloria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "This non-meat isn't even worthy of competing!"
msgstr "Questa non-carne non è nemmeno degna di competere!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY"
msgid "It requireth materials."
msgstr "Richiede dei materiali."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE"
msgid "'Tis in use, and not by me."
msgstr "Questa cosa è in uso, e non da me."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH"
msgid "Alas! 'Tis the wrong plans."
msgstr "Ahimè! Questi sono i progetti sbagliati."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED"
msgid "Alas! It doth not go there!"
msgstr "Ahimè! Non ci va!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY"
msgid "'Tis no time for pleasantries!"
msgstr "Non è il momento per i convenevoli!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC"
msgid "Alas! Bested by cookware!"
msgstr "Ahimè! Battuta dalle pentole!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE"
msgid "I shall wait whilst my allies plan their feast."
msgstr "Aspetterò mentre i miei alleati pianificano il loro banchetto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR"
msgid "I must close the gap between us!"
msgstr "Devo chiudere il divario tra noi!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT"
msgid "I will not crush that hat!"
msgstr "Non distruggerò quel copricapo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE"
msgid "It is engaged."
msgstr "È occupato."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING"
msgid "No further. 'Tis is returning to the earth."
msgstr "Non più. Sta per tornare alla terra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH"
msgid "'Tis tall enough!'"
msgstr "È già alto a sufficienza!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE"
msgid "'Tis dry. I shall see to it later."
msgstr "È vuoto. Me ne occuperò in seguito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING"
msgid "I will let it finish its work."
msgstr "Lascerò che porti a termine il suo lavoro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE"
msgid "I shall valiantly wait my turn."
msgstr "Aspetterò il mio turno valorosamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY"
msgid "First, it must be emptied!"
msgstr "Prima va svuotata!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED"
msgid "Curses!"
msgstr "Maledizione!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE"
msgid "The muses will not visit me if I do not place an item first."
msgstr "Le muse non mi faranno visita se non metto almeno un oggetto prima."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS"
msgid "The plants will like this about as much as I like them."
msgstr "Questo piacerà alle piante quanto loro piacciono a me."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP"
msgid "Come closer, ye wee fishy cowards!"
msgstr "Avvicinatevi, piccoli pescetti codardi!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC"
msgid "Infernal trickster."
msgstr "Impostore infernale."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART"
msgid "The girl's spirit cannot be returned."
msgstr "Lo spirito della ragazza non può essere restituito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY"
msgid "I'll try once more when it's done."
msgstr "Ci proverò di nuovo quando ha finito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE"
msgid "T'will not raise from death, it seems."
msgstr "Non risorgerà dalla morte, così pare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING"
msgid "A warrior must be patient."
msgstr "Una guerriera deve saper essere paziente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM"
msgid "'Tis not to its liking."
msgstr "Non è ciò che desidera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD"
msgid "They'll have better things in Valhalla."
msgstr "Avranno cose migliori nel Valhalla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE"
msgid "We have already conquered this knowledge."
msgstr "Abbiamo già conquistato questa conoscenza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL"
msgid "One sacrifice at a time!"
msgstr "Un sacrificio alla volta!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "T'will not work."
msgstr "Non funzionerà."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART"
msgid "The spirit cannot be returned."
msgstr "Lo spirito non può essere restituito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG"
msgid "The sprite home requires sprucing up. With magical spruce!"
msgstr "La casa del folletto richiede della cura. Con un abete magico!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM"
msgid "Forest sprites have no need of that."
msgstr "I folletti della foresta non ne hanno bisogno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED"
msgid "It longs for its homeland. It will not grow here."
msgstr "Ha nostalgia della sua terra natale. Non crescerà qui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL"
msgid "Nay, that would be foolhardy."
msgstr "No, sarebbe imprudente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON"
msgid "Needs the gaze of Mani to work."
msgstr "Ha bisogno dello sguardo di Mani per funzionare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY"
msgid "Speak plainly! I understand not thine chittering."
msgstr "Smettila di farfugliare! Non comprendo la tua favella."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH"
msgid "That's not worthy to grace the mouth of the gods!"
msgstr "Non è degno di onorare la bocca degli dei!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM"
msgid "This object is not blessed with the power of the gods."
msgstr "Questo oggetto non è benedetto dal potere degli dei."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE"
msgid "That material is not befitting a work of art."
msgstr "Quel materiale non è degno di un'opera d'arte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF"
msgid "The gods may frown were I to do that."
msgstr "Gli dei potrebbero aggrottare le sopracciglia se lo facessi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER"
msgid "Danger is near! 'Tis no time for games."
msgstr "Il pericolo si avvicina! Non è il momento di giocare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY"
msgid "I must clear the battlefield first!"
msgstr "Devo prima pulire il campo di battaglia!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE"
msgid "'Tis too late for revelry!"
msgstr "È troppo tardi per far baldoria!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY"
msgid "Something else hath caught her attention."
msgstr "Qualcosa ha catturato la sua attenzione."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Such sweet slumber... Maybe later."
msgstr "Che dolce dormire... forse più tardi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL"
msgid "One material at a time!"
msgstr "Un materiale alla volta!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT"
msgid "It hath no use for such things while it's in my pocket."
msgstr "Non gli servirebbe a nulla finché è nella mia tasca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN"
msgid "I shall await the small tree's return before presenting it with another offering."
msgstr "Attenderò il ritorno del piccolo albero prima di presentargli un'altra offerta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE"
msgid "Perhaps it shall accept a different offering."
msgstr "Potrebbe accettare un'offerta dissimile."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM"
msgid "This gem was not chosen for this purpose."
msgstr "Questa gemma non è stata scelta per questo scopo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM"
msgid "We must rearrange the bones of the beast."
msgstr "Dobbiamo ridisporre le ossa della bestia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY"
msgid "I'll try once more when they're free."
msgstr "Ci proverò di nuovo quando sono liberi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "They'll have better things in Valhalla."
msgstr "Avranno cose migliori nel Valhalla."

