#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL"
