#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP"
msgid "Knocked it out of the park again, bucko."
msgstr "Un altro grande successo, amico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW"
msgid "Hearty."
msgstr "Genuino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT"
msgid "Shoot. Grams is gonna have a fit."
msgstr "Accidenti. La nonnina prenderà un colpo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I've gotta say, that's some pretty solid construction."
msgstr "Devo dire che si tratta di una costruzione davvero solida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES"
msgid "I can't read when there's work to do!"
msgstr "Non posso leggere mentre c'è del lavoro da sbrigare!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS"
msgid "I was never much of a book learner."
msgstr "Non sono mai stata una che apprende dai libri."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE"
msgid "I prefer hands-on learning."
msgstr "Preferisco imparare facendo pratica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "I ain't too well read."
msgstr "Non sono molto brava nella lettura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE"
msgid "Not really my kinda thing."
msgstr "Non è esattamente il mio genere."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH"
msgid "I learn by doing, not reading."
msgstr "Imparo attraverso la pratica, non con la teoria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL"
msgid "I ain't much of a bookworm."
msgstr "Non sono portata per la lettura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING"
msgid "I prefer to learn from experience."
msgstr "Preferisco apprendere con l'esperienza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE"
msgid "I prefer to learn from experience."
msgstr "Preferisco apprendere con l'esperienza."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED"
msgid "I don't need a book tellin' me how to stick seeds in the ground."
msgstr "Non ho bisogno di un libro che mi dica come mettere i semi nel terreno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT"
msgid "I gotta admit, pretty handy to have a book with a built-in reading lamp."
msgstr "Devo ammettere che è utile avere un libro con una lampada incorporata."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED"
msgid "It's all Greek to me."
msgstr "Non ci ho capito niente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON"
msgid "At this point, I wish I knew less about the moon."
msgstr "A questo punto, preferirei sapere ancora di meno sulla luna."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN"
msgid "I'm too busy to sit around and read."
msgstr "Sono troppo occupata per sedermi a leggere."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION"
msgid "You'll only really learn by gettin' your hands dirty."
msgstr "Solo sporcandosi le mani si impara davvero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE"
msgid "I'd rather have building material than reading material."
msgstr "Preferirei avere dei materiali da costruzione che da lettura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP"
msgid "I already know how to sleep, thanks."
msgstr "So già come addormentarmi, grazie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE"
msgid "Sorry grams, I'm not much of a reader."
msgstr "Mi dispiace, ma non sono una grande lettrice."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES"
msgid "I'm not really a \"book smarts\" kind of gal."
msgstr "Non sono una tipa secchiona."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB"
msgid "This ain't one of them self-help books, is it?"
msgstr "Non è un manuale di crescita personale, vero?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG"
msgid "It's great at comebacks. Ha!"
msgstr "È fantastico per i ritorni. Ah!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG"
msgid "Guess I'd better shake a leg. Ha!"
msgstr "Doveva appartenere a un tipo in gamba. Ah ah!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM"
msgid "I bet I could get it back in working order."
msgstr "Scommetto che potrei riparare questa cosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM"
msgid "Some heat will fix that right up."
msgstr "Un po' di calore e tornerà come prima."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BRUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BRUSH"
msgid "Repetitive tasks are soothing."
msgstr "Le attività ripetitive sono lenitive."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUGNET"
msgid "Wish we had mosquito netting."
msgstr "Avrei preferito una zanzariera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "We can pick it if we can get close enough."
msgstr "Se ci avviciniamo abbastanza, potremmo raccoglierla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED"
msgid "The sea's fulla food, hey?"
msgstr "Il mare è pieno di cibo, no?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT"
msgid "Preferred tool of the foreman."
msgstr "L'attrezzo preferito dal capufficio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE"
msgid "That oughta keep everything nice and fresh."
msgstr "Dovrebbe mantenere tutto bello e fresco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP"
msgid "We could wrap stuff up for later."
msgstr "Potremmo avvolgerci le cose per dopo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN"
msgid "You really oughta get some sun."
msgstr "Dovresti davvero prendere un po' di sole."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW"
msgid "I'm so hungry I could eat a... bunny?"
msgstr "Ho così tanta fame che potrei mangiare un... coniglio?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "Right to a crisp."
msgstr "Croccante al punto giusto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT"
msgid "Just, y'know. Strap a bush on your head."
msgstr "È come legarsi un cespuglio intorno alla testa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUTTER"
msgid "This makes everything better."
msgstr "Fa diventare tutto più buono."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "It has no work or responsibilities. Poor thing."
msgstr "Non ha un lavoro o delle responsabilità. Poverina."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "How you doin' in there?"
msgstr "Come va lì dentro?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN"
msgid "Never liked having butterflies in my stomach."
msgstr "Non mi è mai piaciuto sentire le farfalle nello stomaco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "There's no flight in their future."
msgstr "Non ci sono voli nel futuro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD"
msgid "It lives off the hard work of others."
msgstr "Vive del duro lavoro degli altri."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "That'll do the trick."
msgstr "Problema risolto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It ain't the end."
msgstr "Non è la fine."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Great. We missed our chance."
msgstr "Splendido. Abbiamo perso la nostra occasione."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS"
msgid "That'll put meat on your bones!"
msgstr "Per mettere su un po' di carne sulle ossa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC"
msgid "Prickly."
msgstr "Pungente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED"
msgid "Guess we know who won that one."
msgstr "Sappiamo tutti chi ha avuto la meglio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER"
msgid "Much less prickly."
msgstr "Molto meno pungente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT"
msgid "It's got a sharp taste. Ha!"
msgstr "Ha un sapore pungente. Ah!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED"
msgid "That seems a lot safer."
msgstr "Così sembra molto più sicuro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL"
msgid "Looks a bit fancy, but I'll give it a try!"
msgstr "Mi sembrano fin troppo raffinati, ma li assaggerò!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "On its last legs."
msgstr "È allo stremo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "It'll last me the night, hopefully."
msgstr "Mi durerà per la notte, spero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "A good healthy blaze."
msgstr "Un buon fuoco sano."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW"
msgid "Gonna go out soon."
msgstr "Sta per estinguersi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "About as cozy as it gets out here."
msgstr "Il massimo del comfort da queste parti."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT"
msgid "My sister was afraid of the dark."
msgstr "Mia sorella aveva paura del buio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC"
msgid "That brings back memories."
msgstr "Mi fa venire in mente dei ricordi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD"
msgid "I should take it with me if I go spelunking."
msgstr "Potrei portarlo con me quando vado a fare speleologia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED"
msgid "Everybody out of the mineshaft!!"
msgstr "Tutti fuori dal tunnel sotterraneo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG"
msgid "It's a goodybag."
msgstr "È un sacchetto con le caramelle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CANE"
msgid "It's no Tin Lizzie."
msgstr "Non è di certo un bolide."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM"
msgid "Better load this in the cannon."
msgstr "Sarà meglio caricarla nel cannone."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN"
msgid "Now that'll cheer you right up!"
msgstr "Questo sì che è in grado di tirare su il morale!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like it's on break."
msgstr "Sembra essere in pausa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT"
msgid "Well, this thing's not gonna build itself."
msgstr "Beh, questa cosa non si costruirà di certo da sola."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER"
msgid "It really fancies the place up, doesn't it?"
msgstr "Rende questo posto molto più carino, vero?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT"
msgid "Shouldn't take long to build."
msgstr "Non ci dovrebbe volere troppo per costruirla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE"
msgid "Not sure what I should do with this now that I built it..."
msgstr "Non so cosa dovrei fare con questo, ora che l'ho costruito..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT"
msgid "Let's get crackin'! Ha!"
msgstr "Diamoci da fare!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not really one for knickknacks."
msgstr "Non amo molto questi gingilli."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE"
msgid "Whoever made this did some mighty fine work."
msgstr "Chiunque l'abbia fatto, ha svolto un ottimo lavoro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON"
msgid "Kind of cutesy, but it's growing on me."
msgstr "Abbastanza grazioso, ma sta iniziando a piacermi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT"
msgid "Alright, I gotta know what's inside..."
msgstr "E va bene, devo scoprire cosa contiene..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2"
msgid "Alright, I gotta know what's inside..."
msgstr "E va bene, devo scoprire cosa contiene..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP"
msgid "A bit delicate lookin' for my taste, but at least it works."
msgstr "Ha un aspetto un po' troppo fragile per i miei gusti, ma se non altro funziona."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT"
msgid "Shouldn't take long to build."
msgstr "Non ci dovrebbe volere troppo per costruirla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT"
msgid "You can't exactly hang a swing from it, but it's pretty enough."
msgstr "Non ci si può appendere un'altalena, ma è abbastanza grazioso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT"
msgid "I'll have that set up in a jiffy."
msgstr "Lo monterò in un baleno!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA"
msgid "Err... refreshing...?"
msgstr "Ehm... rinfrescante?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD"
msgid "They're gonna make my hands all grubby. Ha!"
msgstr "Mi sporcheranno le mani. Ha!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT"
msgid "I'll have that set up lickety-split."
msgstr "Finirò il lavoro in un batter d'occhio!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST"
msgid "Looks like a tripping hazard to me."
msgstr "Mi sembra un pericolo di inciampo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like I just need a token to play."
msgstr "Sembra servirmi solo una moneta per giocare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "Yeesh, that mama bird sure has a lot of mouths to feed."
msgstr "Ehi, quella madre pennuta ha un sacco di bocche da sfamare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_CHICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_CHICK"
msgid "I'm gonna getcha!"
msgstr "Ti prenderò!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT"
msgid "Gotta work before you can play."
msgstr "Bisogna lavorare prima di poter giocare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like I just need a token to play."
msgstr "Sembra servirmi solo una moneta per giocare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "Those are some real free-running eggs!"
msgstr "Queste uova vengono indubbiamente allevate a terra!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like a tripping hazard to me."
msgstr "Mi sembra un pericolo di inciampo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.PLAYING"
msgid "It's gotta be that one!"
msgstr "Deve essere quello!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT"
msgid "These birds can't build their own carnival?"
msgstr "Questi uccelli non sono in grado di costruirsi il loro carnevale?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like I just need a token to play."
msgstr "Sembra servirmi solo una moneta per giocare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "Let's get crackin'! Ha!"
msgstr "Diamoci da fare!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT"
msgid "Gotta work before you can play."
msgstr "Bisogna lavorare prima di poter giocare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like I just need a token to play."
msgstr "Sembra servirmi solo una moneta per giocare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "That little ball's got a mind of its own."
msgstr "Quella pallina ha una volontà tutta sua!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like I just need a token to play."
msgstr "Sembra servirmi solo una moneta per giocare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.PLAYING"
msgid "None of the buttons back at the factory were this fancy."
msgstr "Nessuno dei pulsanti della fabbrica era tanto bello."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT"
msgid "Gotta work before you can play."
msgstr "Bisogna lavorare prima di poter giocare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like I just need a token to play."
msgstr "Sembra servirmi solo una moneta per giocare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "I pride myself on being a straight-shooter! Ha!"
msgstr "Mi vanto sempre di essere una che va dritta al punto! Eh eh!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like a tripping hazard to me."
msgstr "Mi sembra un pericolo di inciampo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.PLAYING"
msgid "Time for some pest control."
msgstr "È ora di darsi alla disinfestazione."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT"
msgid "Gotta work before you can play."
msgstr "Bisogna lavorare prima di poter giocare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like I just need a token to play."
msgstr "Sembra servirmi solo una moneta per giocare."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "Well would ya look at that, I'm winning!"
msgstr "Ma guarda un po', sto vincendo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL"
msgid "You can't beat a good old rubber ball."
msgstr "Non c'è niente di meglio di una bella palla di gomma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID"
msgid "Aww, hey little guy!"
msgstr "Oh, ciao, piccoletto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN"
msgid "I haven't been to a fair since I was a kid!"
msgstr "Non vado a un parco divertimenti da quanto ero bambina!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST"
msgid "That's one fancy crow."
msgstr "Quel corvo è davvero elegante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC"
msgid "Hm... this area could stand to be gussied up a bit."
msgstr "Uhm... quest'area avrebbe bisogno di qualche decorazione in più."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2"
msgid "Lookin' pretty good... but I think we can do even better."
msgstr "Ha un bell'aspetto, ma penso che potremmo fare di meglio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3"
msgid "Now that's a fine lookin' tree!"
msgstr "Questo sì che è un bell'albero!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT"
msgid "Gotta set the foundations for the Cawnival."
msgstr "Devo preparare le basi per il cranevale."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC"
msgid "Heh, I always had to win the toys for Charlie when we were kids..."
msgstr "Ah, ero sempre io a dover vincere i giocattoli per Charlie quando eravamo bambine..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT"
msgid "A job well done is its own reward, but gettin' a prize is even better!"
msgstr "Un lavoro ben fatto è la sua stessa ricompensa, ma ricevere un premio è ancora meglio!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC"
msgid "I wonder if I can get anything for one ticket..."
msgstr "Chissà se posso prendere qualcosa con un biglietto..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK"
msgid "Now we're talkin'! Let's take a look at those prizes!"
msgstr "Ora va meglio! Diamo un'occhiata a quei premi!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK"
msgid "I've got a decent pile of tickets going!"
msgstr "Ho messo da parte una bella pila di biglietti!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "Looks like a bag of bird food."
msgstr "Sembra un sacchetto di cibo per uccelli."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A"
msgid "That's a nice little scarf."
msgstr "Bella sciarpa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B"
msgid "Surprisingly well made, considering it was made by birds."
msgstr "Sorprendentemente ben fatto, considerato che è opera degli uccelli."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C"
msgid "It's actually pretty practical for keepin' cool on hot summer days."
msgstr "È piuttosto pratica per mantenersi freschi nelle calde giornate estive."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS"
msgid "That is one sweet saw blade."
msgstr "È una lama circolare fantastica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT"
msgid "You didn't deserve this."
msgstr "Non meritavi una cosa come questa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I... love you."
msgstr "... Ti amo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD"
msgid "That don't look good."
msgstr "Non ha un bell'aspetto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Yer an orange nuisance, aintcha?"
msgstr "Sei uno scocciatore arancione, vero?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD"
msgid "Aw, I can't stay mad at you."
msgstr "Ah, non riesco ad avercela con te."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING"
msgid "Sleep tight."
msgstr "Dormi bene."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER"
msgid "You always did have a competitive streak, didn't ya sis?"
msgstr "Ti piace la competizione, vero, tesoro?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARROT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARROT"
msgid "Free food from the ground."
msgstr "Cibo gratuito della terra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED"
msgid "Easier on the gums. Not that that matters."
msgstr "Più facile da masticare. Non che sia così importante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "A big bunch of carrots."
msgstr "Un bel mucchio di carote."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED"
msgid "Perfectly pluckable."
msgstr "Perfettamente estraibile."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "A handful of seeds."
msgstr "Una manciata di semi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING"
msgid "Welp."
msgstr "Brucia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT"
msgid "It's okay. I'll assemble another."
msgstr "Va bene. Ne monterò un'altra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC"
msgid "Good place to kick your feet up, if nothin' else."
msgstr "Un buon posto per scalciare i piedi, se non altro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CATCOON"
msgid "She'll keep the rats outta the factory."
msgstr "Terrà i topi fuori dalla fabbrica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY"
msgid "As abandoned as an old warehouse."
msgstr "Abbandonato come un vecchio magazzino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "We all gotta sleep."
msgstr "Dobbiamo tutti dormire."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT"
msgid "Do I look like a fur trader?"
msgstr "Sembro una commerciante di pellicce?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE"
msgid "I think it's got a squeaky wheel."
msgstr "Credo abbia una ruota che cigola."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks movable."
msgstr "Sembra mobile."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED"
msgid "I'm just not tall enough."
msgstr "Non sono abbastanza alta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA"
msgid "Everything since I got here has been bananas."
msgstr "Non sapevo che ci fossero banane anche nelle grotte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT"
msgid "Big ol' burnt banana tree."
msgstr "Un grande vecchio albero di banana bruciato."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED"
msgid "Caramelized banana's the tops."
msgstr "Le banane caramellate sono il massimo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE"
msgid "That's, uh, a banana tree."
msgstr "È, ehm, un albero di banane."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE"
msgid "Into the depths!"
msgstr "Nelle profondità!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL"
msgid "They're at capacity down there."
msgstr "Sono in piena capacità quaggiù."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Nah, I don't want blacklung."
msgstr "No, non voglio la silicosi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN"
msgid "Another day, another creepy cave."
msgstr "Un altro giorno, un'altra grotta spaventosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS"
msgid "Is it wise to go deeper?"
msgstr "È raccomandabile andare più in profondità?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL"
msgid "Nah, it's packed up there."
msgstr "No, è troppo pieno quassù."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't need fresh air."
msgstr "Non ho bisogno di aria fresca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN"
msgid "I barely remember what the surface looks like."
msgstr "Ricordo a malapena come sia la superficie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN"
msgid "Take a gander at this tiny fern!"
msgstr "Dai un'occhiata a questa felce!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED"
msgid "Aww, that fern's dead."
msgstr "Oh, quella felce è morta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD"
msgid "It's dead, alright."
msgstr "È proprio morta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC"
msgid "That critter is trouble!"
msgstr "Quella bestiola è un problema!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's sleepin'."
msgstr "Dorme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING"
msgid "It ain't shy about passin' gas."
msgstr "Non si fa problemi a espellere gas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS"
msgid "Smells kinda rotten."
msgstr "Sa di marcio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "Ain't nothin' good comin' out of there."
msgstr "Da lì non esce niente di buono."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT"
msgid "It's gonna get real stuffy down here."
msgstr "La temperatura sta per alzarsi parecchio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA"
msgid "Well that's just toxic."
msgstr "È tossico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE"
msgid "Good to have a way out."
msgstr "È bello avere una via d'uscita."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE"
msgid "Now that's some tasty grub!"
msgstr "Questo sì che è un pasto gustoso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL"
msgid "It gets everywhere."
msgstr "Va ovunque."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIERESIDUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIERESIDUE"
msgid "I must've just missed her... but she left somethin' behind."
msgstr "Dev'essermi sfuggita... Ma si è lasciata qualcosa alle spalle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEROSE"
msgid "Oh, Charlie. What are you gettin' me into now?"
msgstr "Oh, Charlie. In che guaio mi stai cacciando?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND"
msgid "You want something, huh?"
msgstr "Vuoi qualcosa, eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER"
msgid "You can't please everyone."
msgstr "Non si può piacere a tutti."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN"
msgid "Everyone's got their part to play, huh?"
msgstr "Tutti hanno la propria parte, eh?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC"
msgid "Charlie, wait!!"
msgstr "Charlie, aspetta!!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST"
msgid "Who'd build a stage out here? Oh..."
msgstr "Chi ha costruito un palco qua fuori? Oh..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1"
msgid "A heap of spare parts."
msgstr "Un mucchio di pezzi di ricambio."

