#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER"
